course: dictionary
lesson: 4484
title: Hasty words
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: «Hasty» means done very quickly, often too quickly, without enough care or thought. «She made a hasty decision and bought the first bike she saw.» The clue is the word decision: she did not think it through, so hasty means quick and careless.
explain: A hasty person acts too fast. «Don't be hasty» is a warning to slow down and think. The adverb is hastily, as in «He hastily grabbed his coat», which means he moved quickly, in a hurry.
explain: In reasoning lessons, a hasty generalisation is a rule made from too little evidence. «Making a rule from one example is called a hasty generalisation.» One time tells you very little, so look at more examples before you decide.
fact: Hasty means done very quickly, without enough care or thought.
fact: «A hasty decision» is one made in a hurry.
fact: «Make haste» means hurry up. Haste is the noun, and hastily is the adverb.
fact: «Judging a whole group by a few of its members is a hasty generalisation.»
fact: A hasty generalisation makes a rule from one example, and one example tells you very little.
exercise: «She made a hasty decision.» What does hasty mean here? | Happy and calm | *Done quickly, without enough thought | Done slowly and carefully | Very large
exercise: «Don't be hasty» is a warning to | Run faster | Shout louder | *Slow down and think first | Sleep more
exercise: «Making a rule from one example is called a hasty generalisation.» Why is it hasty? | *One example tells you very little | Rules are always long | It uses too many words | The example is too old
test: «He hastily grabbed his coat and ran out of the door.» What does hastily mean? | Slowly and carefully | Quietly | *Quickly, in a hurry | Angrily
test: Which phrase means hurry up? | Make a map | Make a list | *Make haste | Make a wish
exam: Which one is a hasty generalisation? | Checking many dogs before you make a rule | Testing a rule on a new case | Waiting to see more evidence before deciding | *Deciding every dog is fierce because one dog scared you
